{
  "_comment": [
    "v0.2.97 (service endpoints SSOT): ONE case table for where VCO's core services are reached.",
    "The rule: the launcher.db service_endpoints row (migration 047) -> the compiled default. Nothing else is a leg.",
    "Executed by launcher/src-tauri/vct-launcher-core/src/services/service_endpoints.rs tests (Rust: the hub /config,",
    "the launcher's populate, the MCP registration, the manifest placeholders) AND by",
    "tests/test_v0297_service_endpoints_parity.py (Python: vco_lib/service_endpoints.py, which config_projection,",
    "project_init and install.py resolve through). The render is a (C)-tier mirror: the hub answers /config on every",
    "hook call and cannot spawn a Python per request. A new case goes HERE, never in one side's tests.",
    "render_cases: a row (unset fields at the DDL defaults) -> url / port / grpc_port. Every row must satisfy the schema.",
    "absent_row_cases: no row -> the compiled default.",
    "ignored_input_cases: every retired input is PUT IN PLACE for real by both languages (env vars, app_state keys in",
    "the same launcher.db, a services.toml, a vct-config.toml where each language's old reader looked) and the answer",
    "is still the row's (or, with row null, the default).",
    "plan_cases: rows per service (null = no row) -> what lifecycle code may act on: the compose-managed services,",
    "the adopted containers started by name, and the container a start/stop acts on ('' = none: an external URL);",
    "expect_on_zombie: what a zombie container of the service gets (recreate = rm + compose, VCO-managed rows ONLY;",
    "start = orphan-state cleanup + start by name, never rm: adopted containers AND services with no row, whose",
    "ownership is unknown; ignore). Rust: service_endpoints::zombie_action; Python: vco_lib.service_lifecycle.zombie_action.",
    "Rust: service_endpoints::{compose_managed_services, adopted_autostart_container, lifecycle_container};",
    "Python: vco_lib.service_endpoints.plan.",
    "hand_to_vco_cases: the row checks of `hand-to-vco` — Python vco_lib.service_reconcile.hand_to_vco_refusal(...)",
    "is None == Rust service_endpoints::hand_to_vco_allowed. The Services page offers 'Let VCO manage it' where this",
    "holds AND the row is adopted_container (ServiceRuntimeState.hand_to_vco_offered)."
  ],
  "constants": {
    "default_ports": {"weaviate": 8081, "ollama": 11435, "code_embed": 11440},
    "weaviate_grpc_default": 50052,
    "default_scheme": "http",
    "default_host": "localhost",
    "modes": ["vco_managed", "adopted_container", "adopted_external"],
    "retired_inputs": {
      "env": [
        "VCT_WEAVIATE_URL", "VCT_OLLAMA_URL", "WEAVIATE_URL", "WEAVIATE_PORT", "WEAVIATE_GRPC_PORT",
        "GRPC_PORT", "VCT_GRPC_PORT", "OLLAMA_URL", "OLLAMA_PORT", "CODE_EMBED_URL", "CODE_EMBED_PORT",
        "CODE_EMBED_SERVICE_URL"
      ],
      "app_state_keys": ["weaviate.port_override", "ollama.port_override", "code_embed.port_override"],
      "files": ["services.toml", "vct-config.toml"]
    }
  },
  "render_cases": [
    {"name": "weaviate, VCO-managed on the canonical ports", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "vco_managed", "port": 8081, "grpc_port": 50052},
     "expect_url": "http://localhost:8081", "expect_port": 8081, "expect_grpc_port": 50052},
    {"name": "weaviate, VCO-managed copy on an alternate port via 127.0.0.1", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "vco_managed", "host": "127.0.0.1", "port": 18082, "grpc_port": 50053},
     "expect_url": "http://127.0.0.1:18082", "expect_port": 18082, "expect_grpc_port": 50053},
    {"name": "weaviate, adopted container on the upstream default port", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_container", "port": 8080, "grpc_port": 50051, "container_name": "their_weaviate"},
     "expect_url": "http://localhost:8080", "expect_port": 8080, "expect_grpc_port": 50051},
    {"name": "weaviate, adopted external https on 443 renders without a port", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_external", "scheme": "https", "host": "weaviate.example.com", "port": 443, "grpc_port": 443},
     "expect_url": "https://weaviate.example.com", "expect_port": 443, "expect_grpc_port": 443},
    {"name": "weaviate, adopted external https on a non-default port keeps it", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_external", "scheme": "https", "host": "weaviate.example.com", "port": 8443, "grpc_port": 50051},
     "expect_url": "https://weaviate.example.com:8443", "expect_port": 8443, "expect_grpc_port": 50051},
    {"name": "weaviate, IPv6 literal host keeps its brackets", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_external", "host": "[::1]", "port": 8090, "grpc_port": 50051},
     "expect_url": "http://[::1]:8090", "expect_port": 8090, "expect_grpc_port": 50051},
    {"name": "ollama, native process on the upstream default port", "service": "ollama",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_external", "port": 11434},
     "expect_url": "http://localhost:11434", "expect_port": 11434},
    {"name": "ollama, adopted legacy container", "service": "ollama",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_container", "port": 11435, "container_name": "vco_ollama"},
     "expect_url": "http://localhost:11435", "expect_port": 11435},
    {"name": "ollama, remote http on port 80 renders without a port", "service": "ollama",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_external", "host": "gpu.lan", "port": 80},
     "expect_url": "http://gpu.lan", "expect_port": 80},
    {"name": "code_embed, VCO-managed moved port", "service": "code_embed",
     "row": {"mode": "vco_managed", "host": "127.0.0.1", "port": 21440},
     "expect_url": "http://127.0.0.1:21440", "expect_port": 21440}
  ],
  "absent_row_cases": [
    {"name": "weaviate, no row", "service": "weaviate",
     "expect_url": "http://localhost:8081", "expect_port": 8081, "expect_grpc_port": 50052},
    {"name": "ollama, no row", "service": "ollama",
     "expect_url": "http://localhost:11435", "expect_port": 11435},
    {"name": "code_embed, no row", "service": "code_embed",
     "expect_url": "http://localhost:11440", "expect_port": 11440}
  ],
  "ignored_input_cases": [
    {"name": "weaviate: the row beats every retired input", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_container", "port": 18090, "grpc_port": 50060, "container_name": "their_weaviate"},
     "env": {"VCT_WEAVIATE_URL": "http://statement.invalid:1", "WEAVIATE_URL": "http://transport.invalid:2",
             "WEAVIATE_PORT": "3", "WEAVIATE_GRPC_PORT": "4", "GRPC_PORT": "5", "VCT_GRPC_PORT": "6"},
     "app_state": {"weaviate.port_override": "18083"},
     "services_toml": [{"name": "weaviate", "mode": "parallel", "parallel_port": 18082}],
     "vct_config_toml": "weaviate_url = \"http://config.invalid:7\"\n",
     "expect_url": "http://localhost:18090", "expect_port": 18090, "expect_grpc_port": 50060},
    {"name": "weaviate: no row, the retired inputs still do not answer", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": null,
     "env": {"VCT_WEAVIATE_URL": "http://statement.invalid:1", "WEAVIATE_URL": "http://transport.invalid:2",
             "WEAVIATE_PORT": "3", "GRPC_PORT": "5"},
     "app_state": {"weaviate.port_override": "18083"},
     "services_toml": [{"name": "weaviate", "mode": "adopt", "external_url": "http://adopted.invalid:8090/v1/meta"}],
     "vct_config_toml": "weaviate_url = \"http://config.invalid:7\"\n",
     "expect_url": "http://localhost:8081", "expect_port": 8081, "expect_grpc_port": 50052},
    {"name": "ollama: the row beats every retired input", "service": "ollama",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_external", "port": 11434},
     "env": {"VCT_OLLAMA_URL": "http://statement.invalid:1", "OLLAMA_URL": "http://transport.invalid:2",
             "OLLAMA_PORT": "3"},
     "app_state": {"ollama.port_override": "21435"},
     "services_toml": [{"name": "ollama", "mode": "adopt", "external_url": "http://adopted.invalid:11439"}],
     "vct_config_toml": null,
     "expect_url": "http://localhost:11434", "expect_port": 11434},
    {"name": "ollama: no row, the retired inputs still do not answer", "service": "ollama",
     "row": null,
     "env": {"VCT_OLLAMA_URL": "http://statement.invalid:1", "OLLAMA_PORT": "3"},
     "app_state": {"ollama.port_override": "21435"},
     "services_toml": [{"name": "ollama", "mode": "parallel", "parallel_port": 21436}],
     "vct_config_toml": null,
     "expect_url": "http://localhost:11435", "expect_port": 11435},
    {"name": "code_embed: the row beats every retired input", "service": "code_embed",
     "row": {"mode": "vco_managed", "port": 21440},
     "env": {"CODE_EMBED_URL": "http://transport.invalid:1", "CODE_EMBED_PORT": "3",
             "CODE_EMBED_SERVICE_URL": "http://transport.invalid:2"},
     "app_state": {"code_embed.port_override": "21441"},
     "services_toml": [{"name": "code_embed", "mode": "parallel", "parallel_port": 21442}],
     "vct_config_toml": null,
     "expect_url": "http://localhost:21440", "expect_port": 21440}
  ],
  "plan_cases": [
    {"name": "no rows: VCO's own stack, canonical containers",
     "rows": {"weaviate": null, "ollama": null, "code_embed": null},
     "expect_managed_services": ["weaviate", "ollama", "code_embed"],
     "expect_adopted_containers": [],
     "expect_containers": {"weaviate": "vco_weaviate", "ollama": "vco_ollama", "code_embed": "vco_code_embed"},
     "expect_on_zombie": {"weaviate": "start", "ollama": "start", "code_embed": "start"}},
    {"name": "adopted container + external URL are never compose-managed",
     "rows": {"weaviate": {"mode": "adopted_container", "port": 8081, "grpc_port": 50052, "container_name": "their_weaviate"},
              "ollama": {"mode": "adopted_external", "port": 11434},
              "code_embed": {"mode": "vco_managed", "port": 11440}},
     "expect_managed_services": ["code_embed"],
     "expect_adopted_containers": ["their_weaviate"],
     "expect_containers": {"weaviate": "their_weaviate", "ollama": "", "code_embed": "vco_code_embed"},
     "expect_on_zombie": {"weaviate": "start", "ollama": "ignore", "code_embed": "recreate"}},
    {"name": "an adopted container without autostart is not started by name",
     "rows": {"weaviate": {"mode": "adopted_container", "port": 8081, "grpc_port": 50052, "container_name": "their_weaviate", "autostart": false},
              "ollama": {"mode": "adopted_container", "port": 11435, "container_name": "legacy_ollama"},
              "code_embed": null},
     "expect_managed_services": ["code_embed"],
     "expect_adopted_containers": ["legacy_ollama"],
     "expect_containers": {"weaviate": "their_weaviate", "ollama": "legacy_ollama", "code_embed": "vco_code_embed"},
     "expect_on_zombie": {"weaviate": "ignore", "ollama": "start", "code_embed": "start"}},
    {"name": "a disabled vco_managed service is not brought up; a named one keeps its name",
     "rows": {"weaviate": {"mode": "vco_managed", "port": 18081, "grpc_port": 50053, "container_name": "vco_weaviate_alt"},
              "ollama": {"mode": "vco_managed", "port": 11435},
              "code_embed": {"mode": "vco_managed", "port": 11440, "enabled": false}},
     "expect_managed_services": ["weaviate", "ollama"],
     "expect_adopted_containers": [],
     "expect_containers": {"weaviate": "vco_weaviate_alt", "ollama": "vco_ollama", "code_embed": "vco_code_embed"},
     "expect_on_zombie": {"weaviate": "recreate", "ollama": "recreate", "code_embed": "ignore"}},
    {"name": "the Weaviate 'waiting for your choice' row (vco_managed, disabled) is never started or healed",
     "rows": {"weaviate": {"mode": "vco_managed", "port": 8081, "grpc_port": 50052, "enabled": false},
              "ollama": {"mode": "adopted_external", "port": 11434},
              "code_embed": {"mode": "vco_managed", "port": 11440}},
     "expect_managed_services": ["code_embed"],
     "expect_adopted_containers": [],
     "expect_containers": {"weaviate": "vco_weaviate", "ollama": "", "code_embed": "vco_code_embed"},
     "expect_on_zombie": {"weaviate": "ignore", "ollama": "ignore", "code_embed": "recreate"}}
  ],
  "awaits_choice_cases": [
    {"name": "no row yet: nothing has been decided", "service": "weaviate", "row": null, "expect": true},
    {"name": "no Ollama row yet either", "service": "ollama", "row": null, "expect": true},
    {"name": "Weaviate parked by owner ruling Q1 (vco_managed, disabled)", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "vco_managed", "port": 8082, "grpc_port": 50053, "enabled": false}, "expect": true},
    {"name": "VCO's own Weaviate, enabled", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "vco_managed", "port": 8081, "grpc_port": 50052}, "expect": false},
    {"name": "an adopted Weaviate", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_container", "port": 8081, "grpc_port": 50051, "container_name": "their_weaviate"}, "expect": false},
    {"name": "a disabled Ollama is not a pending choice", "service": "ollama",
     "row": {"mode": "vco_managed", "port": 11435, "enabled": false}, "expect": false},
    {"name": "code_embed disabled on a CPU host is not a pending choice", "service": "code_embed",
     "row": {"mode": "vco_managed", "port": 11440, "enabled": false}, "expect": false}
  ],
  "hand_to_vco_cases": [
    {"name": "no row yet: nothing to hand over", "service": "weaviate", "row": null, "expect": false},
    {"name": "an adopted URL is not a container", "service": "ollama",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_external", "host": "gpu.lan", "port": 11434}, "expect": false},
    {"name": "an adopted URL naming VCO's container is still a URL", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_external", "port": 8081, "grpc_port": 50052, "container_name": "vco_weaviate"}, "expect": false},
    {"name": "a row naming no container", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_container", "port": 8081, "grpc_port": 50052}, "expect": false},
    {"name": "a container under another name would come back as a second container", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_container", "port": 8081, "grpc_port": 50051, "container_name": "their_weaviate"}, "expect": false},
    {"name": "an adopted container under the name VCO's compose creates", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_container", "port": 8081, "grpc_port": 50052, "container_name": "vco_weaviate"}, "expect": true},
    {"name": "Ollama: the same rule", "service": "ollama",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_container", "port": 11435, "container_name": "vco_ollama"}, "expect": true},
    {"name": "Ollama under Weaviate's canonical name", "service": "ollama",
     "row": {"mode": "adopted_container", "port": 11435, "container_name": "vco_weaviate"}, "expect": false},
    {"name": "a vco_managed row naming VCO's container passes the row checks", "service": "weaviate",
     "row": {"mode": "vco_managed", "port": 8081, "grpc_port": 50052, "container_name": "vco_weaviate"}, "expect": true}
  ]
}
